1
00:00:00,134 --> 00:00:04,474
(Leonard:)Is it a good time to evaluate the beta test
and see where we stand?

2
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:07,056
(Penny:)Things are looking good.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,100
(Leonard:)So are we still taking things slow?

4
00:00:09,268 --> 00:00:10,848
(Leonard:)Because a gunshot wound today...

5
00:00:11,062 --> 00:00:12,812
(Leonard:)...last week I slammed my thumb.

6
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,860
(Leonard:)We don't know how much time I have.

7
00:00:16,818 --> 00:00:18,818
(Penny:)Good night, you.

8
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,320
First door on the Ieft.

9
00:00:59,485 --> 00:01:08,025
(Penny:)Thank you.

